        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.527,
            0.612,
            0.556
          ],
          "content": "1. Are $\\frac{3}{6} ,  \\frac{4}{8} ,  \\frac{5}{10}$ equivalent fractions? Why?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.574,
            0.572,
            0.601
          ],
          "content": "2. Write two equivalent fractions for $\\frac{2}{6}$ ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.601,
            0.774,
            0.66
          ],
          "content": "3. $\\frac{4}{6} = \\begin{array}{c} \\boxed{\\quad} \\\\ \\boxed{\\quad} \\\\ \\boxed{\\quad} \\\\ \\end{array} = \\begin{array}{c} \\boxed{\\quad} \\\\ \\boxed{\\quad} \\\\ \\boxed{\\quad} \\\\ \\end{array} = \\begin{array}{c} \\boxed{\\quad} \\\\ \\boxed{\\quad} \\\\ \\boxed{\\quad} \\\\ \\end{array} =$ ... (Write as many as you can)"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.672,
            0.781,
            0.695
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Understanding equivalent fractions using equal shares"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.702,
            0.62,
            0.747
          ],
          "content": "One roti was shared equally by four children. What fraction of the whole did each child get?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.748,
            0.62,
            0.792
          ],
          "content": "The adjoining picture shows the division of a roti among four children."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.794,
            0.513,
            0.829
          ],
          "content": "Fraction of roti each child got is $\\frac { 1 } { 4 } .$"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
